  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Lagos State Employment Trust Fund (LSETF)- Jenniez School of African Interior Design</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant is part of USADF&apos;s co-funding partnership with the Lagos State Employment Trust Fund to make grants for vocational training for youth. Jenniez School of African Interior Design is proposing to deliver interior design skills training for 80 unemployed Lagos State residents. They plan to place a number of graduates with several architectural, construction and real estate companies.</narrative>
  </description>
